    "prim",
    "# in prim context @P is the face centre\ncenter = 1 - smoothstep(10, 46, length(@P))\nr = rand(@primnum + 0.37)\n@height = 6 + 40 * pow(r, 2.2) * (0.35 + 0.65 * center) + 18 * center\n@crown = 0.35 * @height\ni@lot = @primnum",
